WEBVTT

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.120
What is that thing?

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.130
It's happening again. It's disappearing.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:51.720
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:58.050
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:04.230
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:09.660
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:15.700
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:22.040
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:27.920
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.970
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:39.810
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:45.980
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.170
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:54.320
Even in the driving wind

00:01:55.110 --> 00:02:01.260
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:06.920
Misekku kesta

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:14.840
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.920
I really have lost my mind.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.730
Yuu...

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.170
What is that?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.910
Yuu, hurry!

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:45.350
Hurry, we have to get away!

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:55.070
Found you.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:57.070
It's him!

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.360
Together again.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.920
You're real chummy, huh?

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.100
Run!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.000
Man, stop wasting my time!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:23.640
Stay back!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:27.110
Something about this kid
gets on my nerves.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.610
That explains it.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:42.100
Didn't think I'd run into
the Karasu of this dimension.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.330
What do you wanna use this for?

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.140
This?

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:08.590
What's the matter? Had enough?

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.090
Damn, I hate kids.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:17.130
They're so cheeky.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:18.940
Honestly...

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:20.740
Yuu!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.910
Maybe I oughta squish
you just like this.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.240
Stop it! Please stop!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.580
It's those eyes.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.530
You do have the same eyes.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.510
Those eyes...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:47.670
infuriate me!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.710
It's happening again.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.330
Karasus of all dimensions...

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.710
Die!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.470
No!

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.710
Yuu, it's moving! Let's go, Yuu.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.030
R-Right!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.750
Hurry, hurry!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.920
Yuu!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.020
So, we still can't stabilize
in this dimension!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:28.270
Why is he after you?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.130
I don't know.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:33.600
Why does someone like that
have to come after me?

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:38.610
That guy's... not human.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.510
Then...

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.650
What was that?

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.950
Something's there.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.360
What's that noise?

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.840
The ceiling...

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.450
- Haruka, grab on to something!
- Right!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.850
Haruka, are you okay?

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.040
I think so.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.440
It's that man...

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.390
It's him.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.650
You again?

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:05.560
Karasu... That's how you take
the credit for other people's work.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.830
You always do that.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:11.300
Karasu.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.060
Die!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:34.530
Bad boy. You know you
shouldn't use Reizu as a shield.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.290
You'll make the Dragon Torque fall.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.520
It's hopeless.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.940
It's hopeless... We're done for.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.700
It's hopeless...

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:19.710
We're gonna die.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.200
Shut up!

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.380
If you don't want to die,
then you have to endure it!

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:32.630
Yuu!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.110
I can't do it!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.520
You're pathetic.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.000
Is giving up the only thing
you can do?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.600
Fight! Show me you have
the guts to fight!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.810
I can't do it!

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:53.070
I'm gonna die.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:55.820
Then die!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.370
Anyone who doesn't have
the strength to live should die!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.310
You're as tough as ever.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:10.800
It's always been an eyesore for me...
that unhappy expression of yours!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:07.680
Yuu?!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.750
Are... you okay, Haruka?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.180
Yeah.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:13.690
Yuu...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.610
You're bleeding!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.740
The reading disappeared.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.570
Uchida-chan, are you sure
it's not a mistake?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.870
Let's head back. It's getting late...

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.630
It's not a mistake!
I'm sure the source is here.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:38.450
Somewhere on this mountain.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:41.950
Doesn't it hurt?

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.850
This is nothing. It's bandaged.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.640
Are you sure you're all right?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.900
Stop turning around every time!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:53.960
But your head's been injured,
and I'm sure your feet hurt too.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.650
Quit bugging me.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.460
He's so stubborn.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.540
Hey, it's the road!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:07.880
Haruka?

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.110
We did it!

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.570
Haruka!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.860
A child?

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:21.120
We're so lucky!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.920
Haruka, are you okay?

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.660
Excuse me!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.690
Could you please give us
a ride to the bottom?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.560
Oh! You're that man.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.410
<i>He is being pulled into the storm.</i>

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.420
<i>One bird has returned to the birdhouse.</i>

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.020
Damn Atori created a
world of trouble for us.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.530
Now he's been forcefully retrieved
through an irregularity.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.140
Kuina, what about the Dragon Torque?

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.370
There's no need for panic, Fukuro.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.840
It's more dangerous to leave
our traces in this dimension.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.030
The strain is already
showing in this dimension.

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:26.990
Obliterate all traces.
It all starts from there.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.750
We also need to locate Karasu.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.750
In order to eradicate every trace.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.200
Kuina?!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.760
Don't worry.
A leg flew back, that's all.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:45.460
It appears this dimension
doesn't like my body.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.880
Do you think I can believe that?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.490
Walking around at this time of night...

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.680
I feel ashamed to be your mother.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:11.100
For the time being, I forbid you
to go outside except to the cram school.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:14.160
And I will take you
to and from there myself.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.580
And then the light flew around.
What do you think it was?

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.180
Hey, hold still!

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:28.510
You're bound to run into things like that
wandering around at this time of night.

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:30.520
Ow!

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:32.080
Okay, all done.

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:35.660
Just because it's summer break don't
go overboard playing at night.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.220
You don't believe me?

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.430
I'm not lying.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:45.170
I thought about fantastic things
a lot at your age too.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.560
I wished for something
exciting and magical to happen.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.950
I haven't been lying!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.300
Oh, forget it! I'm taking a bath.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:09.420
That man's name was Karasu, right?

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.030
I wonder if he's okay.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.750
Hello, it's me.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.830
Those children
didn't appear to be lying...

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.120
but nothing's been destroyed here.

00:15:54.440 --> 00:15:56.630
Oh, don't fret it.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.770
Just think of it as a trip
to see the pretty city lights.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.850
The space that was demolished
was restored successfully.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.910
It's perfect, Tobi.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.500
Kosagi, did you locate
Karasu's position?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.220
I have a reading,
but I can't lock down the coordinates.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:27.710
He still exists in
this dimension, then?

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.870
Yes, that is definite.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:34.210
He must be weak. That's why
his coordinates are unstable.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.980
Stop it! Stay back!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.950
Dragon Torque... Stay back!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.890
- He's deranged.
- It's dangerous!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.560
- We must restore him to full strength.
- The Dragon Torque is dangerous!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.930
Surgery is risky with this
amount of derangement.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:56.770
- The Dragon Torque is dangerous!
- The Juoh Group is demanding.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:59.070
We cannot avoid a small degree of risk.

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:01.790
So, it is all for the sake
of absolute coordinates.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.700
That! If THAT comes here, La'cryma...

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.920
La'cryma...

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.550
...will be disappear!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.220
No! I don't wanna die! Stop it!

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:19.950
Please stop it! Stop it!

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:23.520
No... No!

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:27.110
There's nothing about it in the paper.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.300
That's funny...

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.770
It's not on the news...

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:35.660
and there's nothing about it
on the net either.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.620
And besides...

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.640
the ropeway looks fine.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.480
Yeah, that's the thing.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:46.050
You know, you used to
freak out about seeing things...

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.220
when you were little too.

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:50.050
What?! Ghostly visions?

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:51.590
It wasn't like that!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.960
I stopped having those recently.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.760
By the way, why was it after Goto?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.560
I don't know why either.
It attacked him the other night too.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.030
- What?
- The other night?

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:06.150
Yeah. After we got separated
at the graveyard.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:11.110
So, you were alone with Goto, Haruka?

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.770
Hey, are you two an item?

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:16.380
What?! Y-You're wrong!

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:20.680
Why does that make us an item?
We're just old friends.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:25.120
Then what were you doing
all alone together?

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.260
Nothing in particular...

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:29.010
That's not fair, Haruka!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.930
For as long as I can remember...

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:34.630
I've always had a crush on Goto!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:39.200
Oh, what a shocker!
I don't think I can recover!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.900
Are you serious, Miho?

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:45.000
It can't be helped.
I'll let you have him...

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.910
because we're friends!

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.850
You don't have to, really.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:52.380
And then I will
find myself another love.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:55.350
Bravo! Spoken like a true best friend!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.610
- You can do it, Miho!
- Right on!

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.700
Would you mind
not seeing him for a while?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.320
Huh?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.370
I'm sure you understand.
This is an important time for him.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.670
Um...

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.130
Goodbye.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.360
Yuu...

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:21.890
Huh?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.100
Where is this?

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.830
This place...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:36.250
One... Two... Three... Four...

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.960
Five... Six... Seven... Eight... Nine...

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:41.170
I used to play here with Yuu
when we were little.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.720
Ten!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.800
K-Karasu?

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.470
Are you the one who called me here?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.440
Water...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.510
What?

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:41.620
Water...

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:43.950
Would you give me water?

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.850
Water...

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:00.560
Here's some water.

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:14.550
Um, would you like more?

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:19.010
All right, I'll go get some more okay?

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:34.750
Let's go together, Haruka.

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.340
You're still after Yuu...

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:53.930
Well done, Karasu.
You captured the Dragon Torque.

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.120
Dragon Torque?

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.850
He isn't our target.

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:02.190
You are...

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:04.440
Haruka!

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:30.380
A sleepless night

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.270
The sound of the second hand

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:41.200
The rumble of the
refrigerator in the air

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.990
Just as the moon
through the blinds...

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.900
Waxes and wanes, someday...

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:56.490
The pain will change to warmth

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:01.710
Boat of time...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.960
No matter where it flows...

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:13.090
Most likely we'll meet again

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:16.730
From scars come the
footsteps of dawn

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.930
Rather than sighing,
they secretly...

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:26.040
come pouring down
on every new day

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:30.580
No matter what sky it is

00:24:42.500 --> 00:24:44.490
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.500 --> 00:24:47.170
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:50.800
Noein, why are you here?!

00:24:54.100 --> 00:24:56.260
Haruka will eventually disappear.

00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:02.910
I hate you, Haruka!

00:25:04.150 --> 00:25:06.410
Next, Friends.

00:25:08.060 --> 00:25:10.090
Please don't cry.
